{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107387","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107387/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107387/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107387/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107387","id":3135302273,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc664OqB","number":107387,"title":"Animation Editing Window doesn't properly split the individual components of a vector","user":{"login":"Seboops","id":132464850,"node_id":"U_kgDOB-VA0g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132464850?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Seboops","html_url":"https://github.com/Seboops","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Seboops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Seboops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Seboops/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Seboops/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Seboops/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Seboops/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Seboops/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Seboops/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Seboops/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-11T02:42:10Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T10:38:02Z","closed_at":"2025-06-11T10:37:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n\n\nReproducable in v4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Intel(R) UHD Graphics - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-1005G1 CPU @ 1.20GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1ff7442-f2ca-4bf8-b0cc-9bb776cd719c)\n\nWhen trying to animate the individual components of a Vector, instead of the keyframes showing a float in the inspector, it instead shows the whole vector which, when changed, does not affect the actual source vector at all.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSet up an animation player with an animation\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e484720-b975-4fcd-8e2a-15c93d62cd0d)\nAdd a new track and choose property track, then choose something with a position (e.g. a TextureRect)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96dc68e4-f467-4e13-8e14-ee28d903591a)\nSelect one part of a Vector like the position\n\nInsert a new key\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1ff7442-f2ca-4bf8-b0cc-9bb776cd719c)\nYou get a vector2 in the inspector instead of just the X axis appearing as a float. Also, changing this vector does absolutely nothing. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MrpVectorSplitting.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20683162/MrpVectorSplitting.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousa